# Paint-only practice and tour presentation. Raw diagnostics, scenario identities,
# Git commands, paths and fixture content remain independent of the selected locale.
interaction-practice-picker-title = Practice git
interaction-practice-picker-description = Try real git in a new local temporary folder. Your repositories are untouched. The practice folder may be removed by your system; copy it elsewhere if you want to keep it.
interaction-practice-making = Making a practice repository…
interaction-practice-close = Close
interaction-practice-conflict-title = Resolve a merge conflict
interaction-practice-diverged-title = Merge diverged branches
interaction-practice-detached-title = Rescue a detached HEAD
interaction-practice-published-title = Undo a published commit
interaction-practice-conflict-goal = Resolve greeting.txt, stage it and finish the merge on main. Keep both branches in the history and leave no conflict markers or uncommitted changes.
interaction-practice-diverged-goal = Merge feature into main, keeping the commits from both branches. Finish on main with no uncommitted changes.
interaction-practice-detached-goal = Create and check out a new branch at the detached commit, so the rescue note stays reachable. Leave no uncommitted changes.
interaction-practice-published-goal = Revert the published mistake on main, then push the new commit to origin. Keep the published history and restore the original files. Origin is a local practice repository; no server is contacted.
interaction-practice-conflict-hint = Open greeting.txt under Conflicts. Choose or edit the greeting, save and stage it, then commit with the prepared merge message in the Changes pane.
interaction-practice-diverged-hint = While main is checked out, right-click feature and choose Merge into main.
interaction-practice-detached-hint = Click Branch in the toolbar, give it a name and keep Check it out selected.
interaction-practice-published-hint = Right-click the commit named A published mistake, choose Revert commit, then Push. Reset would rewrite the history people already have.
interaction-practice-scenario-mismatch = This practice repository no longer matches its scenario. Start a fresh one from Practice.
